Subject: [PATCH] Claude A: Task A26 - noi lai MIDI Input port selection ->
 midiInputPort setting

A26_ORIGIN_MAIN_SHA = b139783e4a9b371eab82e55a81704567d54bf2d0

PHAM VI: chi sua ui/js/setupMidiInput.js (Setup MIDI Input Learn UI).
KHONG dung keyEngine.js/modEngine.js/BPM engine/Manual Key/Manual MOD/
ManualPriorityGuard/ControlSource/ui/index.html/ui/setup.html (khong doi
UI layout).

CODE GAP THAT PHAT HIEN (khop dung phan loai task: "co mapping storage
nhung chua dispatch -> PHAI noi"): dropdown chon MIDI Input trong Setup
CHI dung cho UX "Learn" (lang nghe tam thoi de bat Note/CC khi user xoay
knob) nhung KHONG luu lua chon nay thanh setting `midiInputPort` - setting
ma CommandRuntime THAT o main process dung de mo easymidi.Input() (xem
core/command-engine-js/runtime.js, resolveInputPortName()). Truoc day
engine chi fallback sang `midiOutputPort`, dung voi da so truong hop 1
thiet bi 2 chieu, nhung SAI neu user co 2 thiet bi MIDI rieng cho
Input/Output - luc do khong co cach nao tu Setup UI de chi dinh dung
thiet bi Input can dung.

FIX:
1. Khi doi dropdown Input, luu TEN thiet bi (khong phai Web MIDI id - vi
   easymidi khop theo ten) vao midiInputPort qua setSetting(), roi goi
   notifySetupChanged() (co san) de CommandRuntime.reloadMappings() mo
   lai dung Input port ngay, khong can khoi dong lai app.
2. Khi mo lai Setup (session moi, chua co gia tri DOM cu), tu khoi phuc
   dung lua chon da luu bang cach so khop TEN thiet bi (Web MIDI .id co
   the doi giua cac lan cam lai, chi TEN moi on dinh).
3. Sua comment dau file DA LOI THOI (ghi "CommandEngine chua duoc require
   o dau trong app dang chay" - xac nhan lai: app/main.js dong 92 DA
   require + CommandRuntime.start() tu truoc). Comment sai nay khong anh
   huong hanh vi, nhung gay hieu nham khi audit (chinh toi luc dau cung
   suyt hieu nham la co code gap o day). Sua lai cho dung thuc te, khong
   doi hanh vi gi.

PHAT HIEN KHAC (khong sua, dung phan loai task):
- Panel "MIDI Learn (chua kha dung)" (ui/setup.html dong ~308-313) voi
  chu "chua co Driver lang nghe MIDI Input" - UI_STALE, khong phai CODE
  GAP (panel MIDI Input THAT o tren da hoat dong dung). Khong sua vi
  UI LAYOUT = NO CHANGE.
- Cac nhom MIDI Learn khac ngoai "DAW Control: Play/Stop/Record" (Menu/
  Preset/Key-Mod/Plugin) - Learn+Save duoc nhung KHONG co capability
  dispatch tuong ung trong capabilityRegistry.js. Day la tinh nang CHUA
  XAY (Coming Soon hop le, tu UI da ghi ro "chi minh hoa khai niem"),
  KHONG phai day dut can noi - xay dung day du se can them dispatch
  engine moi trong core/command-engine-js/ (pham vi lon hon 1 fix Setup
  don gian), KHONG lam trong A26.
- VST2 "Cai dat kha dung - chua noi Mapping": day la PLUGIN INSTALLER
  (tai/cai VST2 bundle), khong lien quan MIDI mapping infrastructure -
  OUT_OF_SCOPE cho task nay.
- Desktop Audio/MIDI Clock/DAW khac/Melodyne/SoundShifter/VST3 - Coming
  Soon hop le, khong co backend, dung nhu badge da ghi trung thuc.

DA XAC NHAN (khong can sua, da hoan chinh tu truoc):
- DAW selection -> setSetting -> saveSetup() -> IPC that
  (load/save-settings-sync) -> file -> runtime doc lai qua getSetting().
- MIDI Output Mapping: DAW -> Action -> CC/Note/Channel -> persistence ->
  runtime dispatch qua actionRegistry.js - day du cho tat ca action (Beat/
  Master/Retune/Preset/Monitor/Clap/Laugh), khong hardcode CC/Note nao,
  NOT_CONFIGURED trung thuc khi chua cau hinh.
- MIDI Input Learn (daw:play/stop/record): dispatch THAT qua CommandRuntime
  (doc dung midiMappingsV1), IPC setup-changed -> reloadMappings() hoat
  dong dung, khong can restart app.
- AUTO MENU AI virtual port: ensureAutoMenuAiPort() (core/command-engine-js/
  runtime.js) kiem tra port da ton tai truoc khi tao (khong duplicate), tu
  connect luc app.whenReady(), khong bao gio bao CONNECTED gia.

VERIFIED (vm sandbox, chay that setupMidiInput.js da sua):
- Chon Input trong dropdown -> midiInputPort luu dung TEN thiet bi,
  notifySetupChanged() duoc goi.
- Mo lai Setup (session moi) voi midiInputPort da luu -> dropdown tu khoi
  phuc dung lua chon (khop theo ten, khong phai id).

Regression: 0 NEW FAIL that (28 test suite, 2 fail la self-check "khong
sua file cu" cua AutoSongCollector/NowPlayingResolver - bat buoc FAIL vi
task nay dung la sua 1 file cu). Rieng Key/MOD (A25): KeyEngineV2,
ConfidenceV2, MarginEngine, MarginLogger, ModEngineV2, StabilityTracker,
Top1StabilityTimer, TelemetryLogger - TAT CA PASS, khong bi anh huong
(dung nhu yeu cau, khong dung file nao trong nhom bi khoa).
